      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are absolutely right to be proactive, but you are making a critical error by taking high-potency Vitamin K while on warfarin because Vitamin K directly counteracts the blood-thinning effects of your medication. This dangerous combination can cause your blood to clot too quickly, leading to life-threatening strokes or heart attacks, so you must stop the supplements immediately. Your heart rhythm medication and your bone health are both vital, but they cannot be mixed like this without risking your life, so please consult your doctor right away to adjust your regimen safely.",
